+# Performance history
+
+## UserPromptSubmit read path
+
+The repository does not retain a measured full-recall p95 for the
+`UserPromptSubmit` hook on the adversarial synthetic 30-word vocabulary before
+the term-selection fix. Consequently, no pre-fix number is reported here.
+
+The fix changed prompt-term selection to rank terms by inverse document
+frequency, retain at most the top eight, discard terms absent from the store,
+and discard terms occurring in more than one third of the active records (once
+the store has at least 50 records). This prevents common synthetic-vocabulary
+terms from forcing scans of long posting lists.
+
+The repository also does not retain a measured full-recall p95 for that same
+adversarial workload after the fix. Consequently, no post-fix number is
+reported here.
+
+The 35.53 ms and 8.75 ms p95 values in `research/00-evidence-log.md` are not
+substitutes for the missing figures: they measure the BM25 stage alone, with 24
+terms and the top eight IDF terms respectively, rather than the complete
+`UserPromptSubmit` hook on the adversarial synthetic workload.
